# Live answer service (optional).
#
# Leave this unset and the search behaves exactly as it does by default: the
# curated, clearly-illustrative answer page. Set it and the search field asks a
# real model instead, over the same corpus the Knowledge Core is built from.
#
# Deploy your own with:
#   modal deploy pipeline/answer_service.py
#
# Deliberately not committed with a value. The endpoint is a scale-to-zero GPU
# service billed to whoever deployed it, so a URL baked into a public repo lets
# anyone reading the source spend that person's money, and every visitor to a
# deployed copy wakes a GPU.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ANSWER_ENDPOINT=https://<your-workspace>--cb-answer-service-answerservice-web.modal.run
